  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Shows a dialog box in the lower right corner of the <b>avatar</b>&#39;s screen (upper right in Viewer 1.x) with a <b>message</b> and choice <b>buttons</b>, as well as an ignore button. This has many uses ranging from simple message delivery to complex menu systems.</p>
</p>
